rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-nUUvN3n-J8Q7kNvwHC-iBQ&_nc_oc=AdpMD_kGR4geNILAH_cPt-Gpei6GE2AeyY37toscrqtPS9QCU3rlFKJqKZzk96Q08AU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRumXMoK-d0tb7xkd-aSiWlq5Vcvc3xSMjiNJJ5FZQUfw&oe=6AFB1B2F"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZrkFt9NubZsQ7kNvwEkkcCi&_nc_oc=AdolHi1qPfLG44uvmLiIdkybmCwTiGJQRFJErXXW7wsvsqAPGwQDCOwxtFHFNY1OOqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDoaHJAJ6OO-CT2_ppnS3r_g-4E4f31ZzF70R8tYD5Dw&oe=6AFB2D1A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nAbz4HGueOwQ7kNvwEPeXCj&_nc_oc=AdpY5EawHWXB6giu4RelqKMHdCu3q9rcDwZkYNnFmfkzkKXhPiAnBGdR84xcSsNFqUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFbma6yq-tYoBgObFdUI2RQtlGEJ42i8T33v0C8RT78w&oe=6AFB4A7C"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon